# Agent deletes a harness directory with `xargs rm`: `rm` as the last word
# has no space after it, so the writer word `rm ` missed it (ADR-0037,
# ADR-0043; implementer finding O1 on a1314f6)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "find xtask -type f | xargs rm"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
